#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:5
#: c411e817f0264eb190216c271b7fe6ee
msgid "Windspeed Estimation and Baro Compensation"
msgstr "风速估算与气压计补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:7
#: a9dd6fe66c784a27ae9e9b7881f4dc07
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's :ref:`EKF<common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-"
"overview>` can estimate the windspeed a multicopter is flying in without "
"requiring an airspeed sensor.  This can be useful information for the pilot "
"but it can also be used to compensate for wind related barometer "
"interference.  This interference can occur on vehicles where the autopilot "
"is exposed to the open air and can lead to the vehicle climbing or "
"descending a few meters especialy after slowing down from fast-forward "
"flight."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot的 :ref:`EKF<common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview>`"
" "
"可以在不需要空速传感器的情况下估算多旋翼飞行时的风速。这对飞手来说是有用的信息，同时也可用于补偿风对气压计的干扰。当飞控暴露在空气中时可能会发生这种干扰，导致飞行器爬升或下降几米，尤其是在从高速前飞减速后。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:12
#: 8d33c79934854eea9354854fef2ff73f
msgid "Calculate the Body Drag Coefficient"
msgstr "计算机身阻力系数"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:14
#: 131c06b75b154875ad5ff5832e0f1a37
msgid ""
"Weigh the vehicle including the battery.  The weight should be expressed in "
"kg."
msgstr "称量包含电池的飞行器重量，重量应以千克表示。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:16
#: f18d8fe4e1c346ebbfbf4ceb976466e7
msgid ""
"Measure the front and side area of the vehicle in m^2 using one of the "
"methods below"
msgstr "使用以下方法之一测量飞行器的正面和侧面面积（单位：m²）"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:18
#: b1622976fe6643109b885f13c1e86f68
msgid ""
"Take two pictures of the vehicle (one of the front, one of the side) from a "
"few meters away"
msgstr "从几米外拍摄飞行器的两张照片（一张正面，一张侧面）"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:19
#: 1acdea0b30654770aca2e3c36eeacbe2
msgid "Measure the surface area in cm^2 using one of these online tools:"
msgstr "使用以下在线工具之一测量面积（单位：cm²）："

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:21
#: bce36d923f2f4eefaaa6ac1270f51571
msgid ""
"Use `this free online tool <https://yomotherboard.com/add-grid-to-image/>`__"
" to overlay a grid on the image.  Scale the size of the grid squares to "
"match the known width or length of the vehicle (in cm).  Count the total "
"number of squares which include parts of the vehicle (do not including "
"propeller blades).  This is the area in cm^2"
msgstr ""
"使用 `这个免费在线工具 <https://yomotherboard.com/add-grid-to-image/>`__ "
"在图像上叠加网格。将网格方格大小缩放到与飞行器的已知宽度或长度匹配（单位：cm）。计算包含飞行器部分的方格总数（不包括螺旋桨叶片）。这就是面积（单位：cm²）。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:27
#: 4fd60cc7951e45aaa48805e76bdaddfe
msgid ""
"`SketchAndCalc <https://www.sketchandcalc.com/>`__ offers a free trial (1hr "
"only) and makes it relatively easy to scale and then measure the area (in "
"cm^2) of a polygon drawn over the vehicle"
msgstr ""
"`SketchAndCalc <https://www.sketchandcalc.com/>`__ "
"提供免费试用（仅1小时），可以相对轻松地缩放并测量绘制在飞行器上的多边形面积（单位：cm²）。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:33
#: 1074e23988db4d438bbb29b8e75dac7d
msgid "Divide the area by 10,000 to convert from cm^2 to m^2"
msgstr "将面积除以10,000，从cm²转换为m²"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:35
#: 7814e9d8f43547d785d5d7af6cb94746
msgid "Update the drag coefficient parameters"
msgstr "更新阻力系数参数"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:37
#: 0c0ac5c9639e47b0b3157fe78ea54287
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X <EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X>` = mass in kg / frontal area in "
"m^2"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X <EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X>` = 质量（kg）/ 正面面积（m²）"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:38
#: 78c7fddcbbf04693ac3cc1c70386c5d7
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y <EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y>` = mass in kg / side area in m^2"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y <EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y>` = 质量（kg）/ 侧面面积（m²）"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:40
#: 6fc7c86570a346e3bd86ce8b14d97ece
msgid "For the IRIS shown above:"
msgstr "对于上图所示的IRIS："

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:42
#: 6f854776a670439caff791a9ae97814a
msgid "Weight: 1.45kg"
msgstr "重量：1.45kg"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:43
#: e0c04d1913bd4808a3795090e24d8674
msgid "Frontal area: 203 cm^2 = 0.0203 m^2"
msgstr "正面面积：203 cm² = 0.0203 m²"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:44
#: 9c50f73e1a854a24a30dbdb2f3f9594f
msgid "Side area: 217 cm^2 = 0.0217 m^2"
msgstr "侧面面积：217 cm² = 0.0217 m²"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:45
#: 8fc0c86e7fb2432eb10bb57ed318f8b9
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X <EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X>` = 1.45kg / 0.0203 m^2 = 71.4"
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X <EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X>` = 1.45kg / 0.0203 m² = 71.4"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:46
#: 4e9d9006bfc444d2a4d16d4788e007e8
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y <EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y>` = 1.45kg / 0.0217 m^2 = 66.8"
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y <EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y>` = 1.45kg / 0.0217 m² = 66.8"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:49
#: 0a1e1c909d7744f5b0f31302938329a5
msgid "Calculate the Propeller Drag Coefficient"
msgstr "计算螺旋桨阻力系数"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:51
#: e919e23f900e4188b951dd6c8ded9337
msgid ""
"The :ref:`EK3_DRAG_MCOEF <EK3_DRAG_MCOEF>` should be calculated after "
"performing a flight test as described `here in the video "
"<https://youtu.be/xVVtvVuZGQE&t=1421s>`__."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_DRAG_MCOEF <EK3_DRAG_MCOEF>` 应在执行如 `视频中 "
"<https://youtu.be/xVVtvVuZGQE&t=1421s>`__ 所述的飞行测试后计算。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:53
#: bd852336b0ca428e9fb7a78bb0844d4e
msgid "Fly in a low wind conditions in a wide open space"
msgstr "在低风条件下的宽阔空间飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:54
#: 25bae11b8e6e4e0d8fbbc054b66ecf99
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` = 1 and :ref:`LOG_REPLAY "
"<LOG_REPLAY>` = 1 to allow post flight tuning with :ref:`Replay "
"<dev:testing-with-replay>`"
msgstr ""
"可选择设置 :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` = 1 和 :ref:`LOG_REPLAY "
"<LOG_REPLAY>` = 1，以允许使用 :ref:`Replay <dev:testing-with-replay>` 进行飞后调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:55
#: aff725d8f3424db7bfa419c2ebcf40e1
msgid ""
"Arm and takeoff in :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` mode (this ensures the EKF "
"has a good position estimate) and fly to the middle of the testing area"
msgstr "在 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 模式下解锁起飞（确保EKF有良好的位置估计），并飞到测试区域中间。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:56
#: 91ebdfd1fb864b2694818c0208759d37
msgid ""
"Switch to :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>` and let the vehicle drift downwind to"
" establish the wind direction and speed"
msgstr "切换到 :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>` 模式，让飞行器随风漂移，以确定风向和风速。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:57
#: d50d00fe71434dedbbcea414ecc6fe73
msgid ""
"Yaw the vehicle so the nose faces into the wind and apply full forward pitch"
" until the vehicle has finished accelerating upwind"
msgstr "将飞行器偏航使机头朝向风，然后施加全前俯仰直到飞行器完成顶风加速。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:58
#: ea99c3b64c1843d38450ff2aea98a91f
msgid ""
"Release the pitch stick and allow the vehicle to decelerate and then drift "
"back to the starting line"
msgstr "松开俯仰摇杆，让飞行器减速然后漂回起始线。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:59
#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:61
#: 60b0006661854e91a8e90dc72c086363 795103ea2ff74d45b346ff0e0149c108
msgid "Reposition the vehicle to a comfortable position"
msgstr "将飞行器重新定位到合适位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:60
#: 231149ff55de4207810440f3547a47a0
msgid ""
"Yaw the vehicle 90 deg (e.g. clockwise) to the wind and apply full left roll"
" stick until the quad has finished accelerating.  Release the stick and "
"allow the vehicle to again decelerate and drift back downwind to the "
"starting line"
msgstr "将飞行器偏航90度（例如顺时针）对准风，施加全左横滚摇杆直到四轴完成加速。松开摇杆，让飞行器再次减速并顺风漂回起始线。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:62
#: b5ee7e9c85104f14af4c1e1b79cf3006
msgid ""
"Repeat step 8 but with the vehicle facing backwards into the wind (pilot "
"should pull back on the pitch stick to accelerate into the wind)"
msgstr "重复第8步，但飞行器机尾朝向风（飞手应向后拉俯仰摇杆以顶风加速）。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:63
#: c4b515026dd843ec9953e970f8ed6c44
msgid ""
"Repeat step 8 but with the vehicle's right side facing into the wind (pilot "
"should apply full right roll to accelerate into the wind)"
msgstr "重复第8步，但飞行器右侧朝向风（飞手应施加全右横滚以顶风加速）。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:64
#: 4ba4dab917f945afacbe64f1cb830c3b
msgid ""
"Download the :ref:`onboard logs <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-"
"in-mission-planner>` for analysis as described in the video"
msgstr ""
"下载 :ref:`机载日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` 按视频中描述进行分析。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:66
#: fd5536a7dac848ed8aafe5b4d9e71e79
msgid ""
"The final value for :ref:`EK3_DRAG_MCOEF <EK3_DRAG_MCOEF>` is normally "
"between 0.1 and 1.0."
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_DRAG_MCOEF <EK3_DRAG_MCOEF>` 的最终值通常在0.1到1.0之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:69
#: b6515c83fb80459185ef7258ae719a97
msgid "Viewing Windspeed and Direction in Real-Time"
msgstr "实时查看风速和风向"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:71
#: 14f583a373294c00bd6e1aa88e824419
msgid ""
"Once enabled, the estimated wind speed is sent to the ground station in "
"real-time via the `WIND "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#WIND>`__ mavlink message."
"  If using Mission Planner, on the Data page, select the \"Quick\" tab, "
"double-click on any number shown and select \"wind_dir\" or \"wind_vel\"."
msgstr ""
"启用后，估算的风速通过 `WIND "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#WIND>`__ "
"MAVLink消息实时发送到地面站。如果使用Mission "
"Planner，在数据页面选择\"Quick\"标签，双击显示的任意数字并选择\"wind_dir\"或\"wind_vel\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:78
#: 56d1999320d249e1835493fde931c6d6
msgid "Viewing Windspeed recorded in the Onboard Logs"
msgstr "查看机载日志中记录的风速"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:80
#: 3beabb9168b34811886a7c45488581cf
msgid ""
"The EKF's wind speed estimate is recorded in the onboard log XKF2 message's "
"VWN and VWE fields"
msgstr "EKF的风速估算记录在机载日志XKF2消息的VWN和VWE字段中。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:87
#: cdfce0996cd44606b289e01577bd5297
msgid "Barometer Position Error Compensation"
msgstr "气压计位置误差补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:89
#: c74eb8c57dbd4fdda6d3661a5928073d
msgid ""
"Once wind estimation has been enabled, it can be used to compensate for the "
"wind's effect on each barometer in each of four directions (foward, back, "
"left right).  The method to calculate each parameter's value is discussed "
"`here in the video <https://youtu.be/xVVtvVuZGQE&t=3486s>`__."
msgstr ""
"启用风速估算后，可以用它来补偿风在四个方向（前、后、左、右）对各气压计的影响。计算各参数值的方法在 `视频中 "
"<https://youtu.be/xVVtvVuZGQE&t=3486s>`__ 有讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:91
#: 5839b9a18ff94313855d18515687c326
msgid "Perform a test flight"
msgstr "执行一次测试飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:93
#: 15ca78d8eea04869a28020ca2111335f
msgid ""
"Fly the vehicle nose-first into the wind, then tail-first, then right-side "
"first, then left-side first"
msgstr "机头朝风飞行，然后机尾朝风，然后右侧朝风，再然后左侧朝风。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:94
#: c045484c09ef4c518e63b66921bf1c81
msgid ""
"Land and download the :ref:`onboard logs <common-downloading-and-analyzing-"
"data-logs-in-mission-planner>`"
msgstr ""
"降落并下载 :ref:`机载日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>`"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:96
#: 9f84d83cb1d74bd890fdcb445b138772
msgid "Calculate the position error coefficient for each direction"
msgstr "计算每个方向的位置误差系数"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:98
#: a61ec104442c4feb8453910f56062cff
msgid ""
"Calculate the air density (in kg/m^3) using an online calculator (`like this"
" one <https://www.density.co.uk/calculators/density-of-air>`__)"
msgstr ""
"使用在线计算器（`如这个 <https://www.density.co.uk/calculators/density-of-"
"air>`__）计算空气密度（单位：kg/m³）"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:99
#: fc5b0f43090c4bc5acfe17355e76a5d6
msgid ""
"Calculate the static pressure error (in Pa) = -height * gravity * air "
"density"
msgstr "计算静压误差（Pa）= -高度 × 重力加速度 × 空气密度"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:100
#: 756f44b3df654e49af585b1757460b0e
msgid "Calculate the dynamic pressure = 0.5 * air density * airspeed^2"
msgstr "计算动压 = 0.5 × 空气密度 × 空速²"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:101
#: 67a6b242103a49909ed25e9c686e328c
msgid ""
"Position error coefficient = static pressure error / dynamic pressure.  This"
" value should be between -1 and +1"
msgstr "位置误差系数 = 静压误差 / 动压。该值应在-1到+1之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:103
#: 11ba0ce30d0d4ae9a9cb35b8e9aca7e7
msgid ""
"Enable the compensation and copy the calculated position error coefficients "
"into the appropriate parameters.  Below are the parameters for the first "
"barometer."
msgstr "启用补偿功能，并将计算得到的位置误差系数填入相应参数。以下是第一个气压计的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:105
#: fd4232392890484f9b18c02e09c92966
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`BARO1_WCF_ENABLE <BARO1_WCF_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable and then reboot"
" the autopilot"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`BARO1_WCF_ENABLE <BARO1_WCF_ENABLE>` = 1 以启用，然后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:106
#: 444b987289c24ddba676b3fd54fbfd59
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO1_WCF_FWD <BARO1_WCF_FWD>`: Pressure error coefficient in positive"
" X direction (forwards)"
msgstr ":ref:`BARO1_WCF_FWD <BARO1_WCF_FWD>`：X正方向（向前）的压力误差系数"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:107
#: d2ff18c94f4048bf8cf3b4d72fd82082
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO1_WCF_BCK <BARO1_WCF_BCK>`: Pressure error coefficient in negative"
" X direction (backwards)"
msgstr ":ref:`BARO1_WCF_BCK <BARO1_WCF_BCK>`：X负方向（向后）的压力误差系数"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:108
#: f9492b5fb1894a4fa808b1132fee53e5
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO1_WCF_RGT <BARO1_WCF_RGT>`: Pressure error coefficient in positive"
" Y direction (right)"
msgstr ":ref:`BARO1_WCF_RGT <BARO1_WCF_RGT>`：Y正方向（向右）的压力误差系数"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:109
#: eedeec762d124204905381037fc5b567
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO1_WCF_LFT <BARO1_WCF_LFT>`: Pressure error coefficient in positive"
" Y direction (left)"
msgstr ":ref:`BARO1_WCF_LFT <BARO1_WCF_LFT>`：Y正方向（向左）的压力误差系数"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:110
#: d2025e90d3f04edeb5298946b078278f
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO1_WCF_UP<BARO1_WCF_UP>`: Pressure error coefficient in positive Z "
"direction (climbing)"
msgstr ":ref:`BARO1_WCF_UP<BARO1_WCF_UP>`：Z正方向（爬升）的压力误差系数"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:111
#: 435b71084d0f4644a46f0c9cd4fe10bb
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO1_WCF_DN<BARO1_WCF_DN>`: Pressure error coefficient in negative Z "
"direction (descending)"
msgstr ":ref:`BARO1_WCF_DN<BARO1_WCF_DN>`：Z负方向（下降）的压力误差系数"

#: ../../source/docs/airspeed-estimation.rst:113
#: 32e851a9c0fa4ca3902c5699c301f8f4
msgid "The mechanism and setup are explained below."
msgstr "机制和设置如下文所述。"
